<title>LEBANON: Blast kills policeman in east Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Blast kills policeman in east Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Lebanese policeman was killed early on Friday in a bomb blast in the Syrian-controlled eastern Bekaa, security sources said.</p>
<p>They said policeman Toni Abu Haidar died and his brother was wounded when an unknown person set off a bomb outside the policeman's house in the village of Talia, 70 km (42 miles) east of Beirut.</p>
<p>Police sources said they were investigating.</p>
</text>
